---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: How to reach us
---

<h1 data-i18n="nav.contact">Contact</h1>

<p>
  If you need to reach {{ site.brand or site.name }}, please use the contact information below.
</p>

{% if site.contactEmail %}
  <p>
    <strong data-i18n="contact.emailLabel">Email:</strong>
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>
  </p>
{% else %}
  <p class="muted">
    <span data-i18n="contact.unavailable">Contact information is not available right now.</span>
  </p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Content removal</h2>
<p>
  If you believe any content on this site infringes your rights or should be removed, please see
  <a href="{{ '/takedown/' | url }}">Takedown Requests</a>.
</p>
